---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/ui/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/ui/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — FindSongKey"
  description="Read FindSongKey's terms and conditions. Understand the rules governing the use of our free BPM and key detection tool."
  canonical="https://findsongkeybpm.com/terms"
>
  <Header />
  <main class="content-page" id="terms">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="content-meta">Last updated: June 4, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Welcome to FindSongKey. By accessing or using our website at
      <a href="https://findsongkeybpm.com" class="content-link">findsongkeybpm.com</a>,
      you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with
      any part of these terms, please do not use our service.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Description of service</h2>
    <p>
      FindSongKey provides a free, browser-based tool that analyzes audio files to
      detect BPM (beats per minute), musical key, and Camelot wheel codes. All
      analysis is performed locally in your web browser — no audio data is
      transmitted to our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree to use FindSongKey only for lawful purposes. You may not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Use the service to analyze audio files for which you do not have the
        necessary rights or permissions
      </li>
      <li>
        Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or extract the source code of
        our proprietary analysis algorithms
      </li>
      <li>
        Use automated systems (bots, scrapers) to access the service in a way
        that places an unreasonable load on our infrastructure
      </li>
      <li>
        Distribute, sublicense, or commercially resell the service without
        written permission
      </li>
      <li>
        Use the service to infringe upon the intellectual property rights of
        others
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      All content on FindSongKey — including but not limited to the website
      design, logos, text, graphics, and software — is the property of
      FindSongKey and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
      You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from any
      content without prior written consent.
    </p>

    <h2>4. User content</h2>
    <p>
      Audio files you analyze using FindSongKey remain entirely your property.
      Since all processing happens locally in your browser, we never access,
      store, or claim any rights to your audio files or analysis results.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Accuracy disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      While we strive to provide accurate BPM and key detection, results are
      generated by automated algorithms and may not always be perfectly accurate.
      Factors such as audio quality, complex time signatures, key changes, and
      genre-specific characteristics can affect detection accuracy. Results should
      be used as a reference and verified when precision is critical.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      FindSongKey is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without
      warranties of any kind, either express or implied. To the fullest extent
      permitted by law:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free,
        or free from harmful components
      </li>
      <li>
        We are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential,
        or punitive damages arising from your use of the service
      </li>
      <li>
        Our total liability shall not exceed the amount paid by you for access
        to the service (which is zero, as the service is free)
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Third-party links and services</h2>
    <p>
      Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are
      not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of any
      third-party sites. Accessing linked websites is at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      FindSongKey displays advertisements through Google AdSense to support our
      free service. Ad content is served by Google and is subject to Google's own
      terms and privacy policies. We do not endorse or guarantee any products or
      services advertised on our site.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Modifications to terms</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at any
      time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      Your continued use of the service after changes are posted constitutes
      acceptance of the revised terms.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Termination</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to FindSongKey at our
      discretion, without notice, for conduct that we determine violates these
      terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance
      with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be resolved
      through good-faith negotiation or, if necessary, through appropriate legal
      proceedings.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about these Terms and Conditions, please reach out
      through our <a href="/contact" class="content-link">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
